{"createdAt":"2026-09-30T12:11:10.445Z","data":{"body":[{"_key":"p2","_type":"image","alt":"Image from Gyazo","asset":{"_ref":"01M3TNWQ51J8P14CSK2Q7P1C7V","_type":"reference","url":"../../media/4b23cb787c6d48925d3440c28610bfceee1b4f9ddc7a4ab5cf80011ef824b2bc.png"},"height":1890,"link":{"href":"../../media/4b23cb787c6d48925d3440c28610bfceee1b4f9ddc7a4ab5cf80011ef824b2bc.png"},"width":2142},{"_key":"p2-g1","_type":"poc_markdown","body":"&#xA;Obsidianが便利すぎます。"},{"_key":"p4","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p3","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Obsidianってなに"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"p5","_type":"poc_markdown","body":"- 基本機能はNotionと同じで、[Markdown](/ja/tech/markdown/)を使って記述する\n- Notionは、階層でデータを保存していくイメージで、Obsidianでは、記事間のリンクなどでデータを構造化するイメージ\n- Notionのほうがぶっちゃけ機能は豊富なんだけど、Obsidianはローカル動作する&明らかにNotionより軽量\n  - Notionの機能を使いこなせない&特定の機能とかAPIが欲しい自分にとってピッタリだった\n- 見た目とか、挙動とかを、コミュニティが開発したテーマやプラグインで制御できる"}],"description":"このブログもObsidianで書いています","emoji":"🪨","exclude_from_listing":0,"is_translated":0,"is_work_in_progress":1,"legacy_editable":{"description":"このブログもObsidianで書いています","emoji":"🪨","exclude_from_listing":false,"is_translated":false,"is_work_in_progress":true,"legacy_published_at":"2025-11-14","tags":["dev","favourite-things"],"title":"Obsidian便利すぎませんか？"},"legacy_frontmatter":{"description":"このブログもObsidianで書いています","emoji":"🪨","isDraft":true,"isTranslated":null,"published_at":"2025-11-14","tags":["dev","favourite-things"],"title":"Obsidian便利すぎませんか？"},"legacy_path":"ja/misc/obsidian.md","legacy_published_at":"2025-11-14","public_path":"ja/misc/obsidian","tags":["dev","favourite-things"],"title":"Obsidian便利すぎませんか？"},"id":"01M3S3KM7DGHTZ9V5ADDDJVG8V","locale":"ja","publishedAt":"2025-11-14T00:00:00.000Z","seo":{"canonical":null,"description":null,"image":null,"noIndex":false,"title":null},"slug":"obsidian","translationGroup":"01M3S3KM7DGHTZ9V5ADDDJVG8V"}
